#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This example demonstrates vehicle responses to a 40 km/h crosswind encountered 2 seconds into the simulation. No steering correction is applied.
#
#This example uses the same Procedure as the overlay, "Crosswind w/ Steering", but in this case the steering control has been overridden with the Open Loop Steering Control dataset "Zero Degrees", linked at the bottom of the Run Control screen.
#
#Animation shapes representing the aerodynamic forces and moments on the vehicle have been linked on the Procedure screen to make it easier to visualize the vehicle's reactions to the crosswind.
#
#To see how this test was set up, including the wind speed and heading, click on the Procedures blue link "Crosswind Test w/ Steering" for more information.
#
#
#
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

